  "title": {
    "zh": "重接供电网",
    "en": "Power Network Reconnect"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "连通组 · 逐次合并 · 即时查线",
    "en": "Connected groups · Incremental links · Live checks"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "有 size 个供电柜，编号 0 到 size−1，起初互不连接。按顺序处理 events。[\"link\", a, b] 在两柜间接一条双向线，重复接线无额外影响。[\"probe\", a, b] 要报告 [a 所在连通组的柜数, b 是否也在组内]，柜数含 a，第二项是布尔值。只返回各次 probe 的报告。没有连线也算与自己连通。",
    "en": "There are size power cabinets numbered zero through size−1. They start disconnected. Process events in order. [\"link\", a, b] adds a two-way cable, with no extra effect for repeated links. [\"probe\", a, b] reports [number of cabinets reachable from a, whether b is reachable from a]. Include a in the count and use a boolean for the second item. Return the probe reports only. A cabinet can always reach itself."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "reconnect_network",
  "starterCode": "def reconnect_network(size, events):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "def cabinet_group(parent, cabinet):\n    while parent[cabinet] != cabinet:\n        cabinet = parent[cabinet]\n    return cabinet\n\ndef reconnect_network(size, events):\n    parent = []\n    counts = []\n    for cabinet in range(size):\n        parent.append(cabinet)\n        counts.append(1)\n    report = []\n    for event in events:\n        a = cabinet_group(parent, event[1])\n        b = cabinet_group(parent, event[2])\n        if event[0] == \"probe\":\n            report.append([counts[a], a == b])\n        elif a != b:\n            if counts[a] < counts[b]:\n                saved = a\n                a = b\n                b = saved\n            parent[b] = a\n            counts[a] += counts[b]\n    return report\n",
